{"name":"Interesting Aqua","hex":"#9bafb2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"interesting","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Arousing or holding the attention or interest of someone.","Pregnant. (used with situation and condition) .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of interest"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/interesting"},{"term":"aqua","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Water (as a compound).","A shade of colour, usually a mix of blue and green, most often similar to the colour cyan, though also sometimes closer to turquoise or aquamarine."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a greenish-blue colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/aqua"}],"entries":[{"title":"Aqua (Kingdom Hearts)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua  is a character from Square Enix's video game franchise Kingdom Hearts. First making cameo appearances in Kingdom Hearts II and its updated version Final Mix, she is introduced in the prequel Kingdom Hearts Birth by Sleep alongside her friends Terra and Ventus. The three are Keyblade apprentices training under Keyblade Master Eraqus, and are the playable protagonists. As the only one among her friends to obtain the rank of Keyblade Master, Aqua is assigned to monitor Terra and Ventus as she combats dark creatures known as the Unversed."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/84/Kingdom_Hears_Aqua.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(Kingdom_Hearts)","wikidata":"Q2859118"},{"title":"Aqua (Angra album)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua is the seventh studio album by the Brazilian power metal band Angra. It was released on August 11, 2010 and August 17, 2010 in Japan and Brazil, respectively. It is their last recording to feature Edu Falaschi on lead vocals, and their only studio album on which drummer Ricardo Confessori returns."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2f/Aquaangra.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(Angra_album)","wikidata":"Q2859119"},{"title":"Interest (emotion)","blocks":[{"text":"Interest is a feeling or emotion that causes attention to focus on an object, event, or process. In contemporary psychology of interest, the term is used as a general concept that may encompass other more specific psychological terms, such as curiosity and to a much lesser degree surprise."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Interest_%28emotion%29.jpg/330px-Interest_%28emotion%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interest_(emotion)","wikidata":"Q616314"},{"title":"Aqua (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua is a variation of the color cyan. The normalized color coordinates for the two web colors named aqua and cyan are identical. It was one of the three secondary colors of the RGB color model used on computer and television displays. In the HSV color wheel aqua is precisely halfway between blue and green. However, aqua is not the same as the primary subtractive color named process cyan used in printing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Shaheed_Island%2C_Andamans%2C_Bay%2C_Turquoise_water.jpg/330px-Shaheed_Island%2C_Andamans%2C_Bay%2C_Turquoise_water.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(color)","wikidata":"Q372733"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Willa_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Willa_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Willa_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Willa_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Willa_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Willa_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Willa Holland has voiced Aqua in all her English appearances.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWilla_Holland_PaleyFest_2015_(cropped).jpg"}],"sounds":{"interesting":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/En-us-interesting-2.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/En-us-interesting-2.ogg/En-us-interesting-2.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/En-us-interesting.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2e/En-us-interesting.ogg/En-us-interesting.ogg.mp3"}],"aqua":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.j